❆ Prepare buffets for parties and events; 
❆ Prepare dishes served in our restaurant, on the terrace and in our self-service restaurant; 
❆ Ensure all mise en place is prepared correctly and on time; 
❆ Keep the kitchen and work areas clean and ensure kitchen equipment is properly maintained; 
❆ Contribute to a smooth and efficient kitchen operation, especially during busy periods. 
What do we ask? 
❆ You have completed a professional cooking or culinary education; 
❆ You have relevant work experience in a similar position; 
❆ You have good communication and social skills; 
❆ You are hands-on and remain calm and focused during busy periods; 
❆ You enjoy working hard during peak service as much as preparing and creating great dishes behind the scenes; 
❆ You are available to work between 32 and 38 hours per week, including weekdays, weekends and evenings; 
❆ You have knowledge of HACCP guidelines; 
❆ You are enthusiastic, flexible and enjoy working as part of a team. 
